      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771119762977,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sea v ∈ V un vector, como pertenece a V podemos escribirlo en términos de la base Bv tq: ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sea v ∈ V un vector, como pertenece a V podemos escribirlo en términos de la base Bv tq: ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JCHnqzxPzw1_AgfzIvEuV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7440.332143316544,
      "y": 5885.583518337289,
      "width": 757.316650390625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "wtoYBggReLR8qiHndCB0t",
      "index": "bF6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 465297076,
      "version": 368,
      "versionNonce": 341247412,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771119762978,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "v = λ1v1 + ... + λnvn con λ1, ... , λn escalares",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "v = λ1v1 + ... + λnvn con λ1, ... , λn escalares",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jYWBSUccDQ8Zeibfp4BHW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7034.501178728558,
      "y": 5169.750185003953,
      "width": 1034.4166259765625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "wtoYBggReLR8qiHndCB0t",
      "index": "bFB",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1733178932,
      "version": 388,
      "versionNonce": 72625972,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771119762978,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Partiendo de esta definición tenemos el siguiente Teorema:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Partiendo de esta definición tenemos el siguiente Teorema:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2Vq17SfyqLIGL2Ten_5fE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7035.600020804452,
      "y": 5242.702565956335,
      "width": 845.9500122070312,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "wtoYBggReLR8qiHndCB0t",
      "index": "bFC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 98557964,
      "version": 698,
      "versionNonce": 502278324,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771119762978,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sea V,W Espacios Vectoriales de dimensión finita\nBv = {v1, ... , vn} una base de V\nBw = {w1, ... , wm} una base de W\nT : V -> W una transformación lineal.\n\nSea v ∈ V un vector\n\nEntonces tenemos que:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sea V,W Espacios Vectoriales de dimensión finita\nBv = {v1, ... , vn} una base de V\nBw = {w1, ... , wm} una base de W\nT : V -> W una transformación lineal.\n\nSea v ∈ V un vector\n\nEntonces tenemos que:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "XtKG263vUYSo9AW_mj9m_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7380.4869052213035,
      "y": 5641.809708813476,
      "width": 551.7999877929688,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "wtoYBggReLR8qiHndCB0t",
      "index": "bFD",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 19786508,
      "version": 152,
      "versionNonce": 1691415092,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771119762978,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[T(v)]Bw = [T]Bv,Bw * [v] Bv",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[T(v)]Bw = [T]Bv,Bw * [v] Bv",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LZDa0lFTpRMSFs14GLprf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7050.129762364165,
      "y": 5958.107327861095,
      "width": 613.9833374023438,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "wtoYBggReLR8qiHndCB0t",
      "index": "bFG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1138136244,
      "version": 82,
      "versionNonce": 2010942388,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771119762978,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Si aplicamos T a v, y por linealidad:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Si aplicamos T a v, y por linealidad:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9z2ZO6kOtREnzBTKjQGb8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7444.804770502185,
      "y": 6040.27399452776,
      "width": 940.9166870117188,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "wtoYBggReLR8qiHndCB0t",
      "index": "bFH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 838358964,
      "version": 434,
      "versionNonce": 691598644,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771119762978,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "T(v) = λ1T(v1) + ... + λnT(vn) con λ1, ... , λn escalares",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "T(v) = λ1T(v1) + ... + λnT(vn) con λ1, ... , λn escalares",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ay2Cp17HRiwzgwdHeBDfP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7054.804760329659,
      "y": 6120.607327861095,
      "width": 1786.050048828125,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "wtoYBggReLR8qiHndCB0t",
      "index": "bFI",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1299097868,
      "version": 246,
      "versionNonce": 374091444,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771119762978,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Por la definición del T(vj) se pueden escribir cada imágen del vector de la base Bv en términos de Bw:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Por la definición del T(vj) se pueden escribir cada imágen del vector de la base Bv en términos de Bw:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "BzIAQP-ojrlga9JviGC-u",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7218.338085524973,
      "y": 6226.940661194428,
      "width": 1526.5833740234375,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "wtoYBggReLR8qiHndCB0t",
      "index": "bFJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 576694580,
      "version": 527,
      "versionNonce": 1069299764,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1771119762978,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "T(v) = λ1(a11 w1 + ... + am1 wm) + ... + λn(a1n w1 + ... + amn wm) con λ1, ... , λn escalares",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "T(v) = λ1(a11 w1 + ... + am1 wm) + ... + λn(a1n w1 + ... + amn wm) con λ1, ... , λn escalares",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
