    {
      "id": "XK3SavvWelIjMS46wypJw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6936.10504227686,
      "y": 11323.970561175274,
      "width": 670.75,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "NS4yhpUWjX5wMtiA5KJdy",
      "index": "bJg",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1143926832,
      "version": 110,
      "versionNonce": 1160836517,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776551704548,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(I) => (II) : f Biyectiva => f inyectiva",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(I) => (II) : f Biyectiva => f inyectiva",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cHbMVn4JExgSHiupp1GzJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6941.10504227686,
      "y": 11388.970561175274,
      "width": 1146.2667236328125,
      "height": 90,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "NS4yhpUWjX5wMtiA5KJdy",
      "index": "bJh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1298266320,
      "version": 180,
      "versionNonce": 1093466373,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776551704548,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Es trivial por la definición misma de f Biyectiva que nos exige que\nf sea inyectiva y sobreyectiva",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Es trivial por la definición misma de f Biyectiva que nos exige que\nf sea inyectiva y sobreyectiva",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TgnVB3pb13qyWkdzT9EsN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6941.98004227686,
      "y": 11500.220561175274,
      "width": 725.9000244140625,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "NS4yhpUWjX5wMtiA5KJdy",
      "index": "bJi",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 375001296,
      "version": 204,
      "versionNonce": 428970085,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776551704548,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(II) => (III) : f Inyectiva => Nu(f) = {0}",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(II) => (III) : f Inyectiva => Nu(f) = {0}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VDp0mAAy-yyrakLoNUmt5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6941.721680460454,
      "y": 11558.970561175274,
      "width": 1110.8499755859375,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "NS4yhpUWjX5wMtiA5KJdy",
      "index": "bJj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1450709552,
      "version": 390,
      "versionNonce": 1546402757,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776551704548,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ya demostrada arriba en t inyectiva <=> Nu(t) = {0}\nen esta parte usamos f(0) para igualar f(v) = f(0) y probar que\nv = 0",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ya demostrada arriba en t inyectiva <=> Nu(t) = {0}\nen esta parte usamos f(0) para igualar f(v) = f(0) y probar que\nv = 0",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "2IqqyL-YUKp6VBhIs57gG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6942.143125307924,
      "y": 11706.053894508608,
      "width": 703.9166870117188,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "NS4yhpUWjX5wMtiA5KJdy",
      "index": "bJk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2064601808,
      "version": 283,
      "versionNonce": 18512677,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776551704548,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(III) => (I) : Nu(f) = {0} => f Biyectiva",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(III) => (I) : Nu(f) = {0} => f Biyectiva",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0zMyDOUX7VBFVDj_YoG0k",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6941.334816388654,
      "y": 11767.720561175272,
      "width": 1569.5167236328125,
      "height": 540,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "NS4yhpUWjX5wMtiA5KJdy",
      "index": "bJl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 377063984,
      "version": 1039,
      "versionNonce": 550096517,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776551704548,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Como el Nu(f) = {0}, podemos decir que f es inyectiva (por misma razón del\nsi y solo si de arriba, conviene demostrar que de f(v1) = f(v2) podemos llegar\na que v1 = v2).\n\nLuego por el Teorema de la dimensión:\ndim V = dim Nu(f) + dim Im(f)\ndim V = 0 + dim Im(f)\ndim V = dim Im(f)\n\nPor el enunciado, dim V = dim W = dim Im(f)  podrían tener la misma base => W = Im(f) => \n\nf sobreyectiva. Luego por f inyectiva y f sobreyectiva => f biyectiva",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Como el Nu(f) = {0}, podemos decir que f es inyectiva (por misma razón del\nsi y solo si de arriba, conviene demostrar que de f(v1) = f(v2) podemos llegar\na que v1 = v2).\n\nLuego por el Teorema de la dimensión:\ndim V = dim Nu(f) + dim Im(f)\ndim V = 0 + dim Im(f)\ndim V = dim Im(f)\n\nPor el enunciado, dim V = dim W = dim Im(f)  podrían tener la misma base => W = Im(f) => \n\nf sobreyectiva. Luego por f inyectiva y f sobreyectiva => f biyectiva",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
