      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "6zczKIIguk4bPQNhQw0Xs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9221.574490790314,
      "y": 11328.613418318126,
      "width": 841.9666748046875,
      "height": 630,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "NXkdyAx3ZVT6ub2Sn7UrI",
      "index": "bJw",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 216705483,
      "version": 663,
      "versionNonce": 37092357,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1776551713415,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Si existe A⁻¹ entonces sabemos que A * A⁻¹ = In\n\nSi aplicamos el determinante tendremos que:\n\ndet ( A * A⁻¹ ) = det ( In )\ndet ( A * A⁻¹ ) = 1\n\nPor propiedades de Determinante entonces:\n\ndet(A) * det(A⁻¹) = 1\n\nLo que implica automáticamente que:\n\ndet(A) != 0 ^ det(A⁻¹) != 0",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Si existe A⁻¹ entonces sabemos que A * A⁻¹ = In\n\nSi aplicamos el determinante tendremos que:\n\ndet ( A * A⁻¹ ) = det ( In )\ndet ( A * A⁻¹ ) = 1\n\nPor propiedades de Determinante entonces:\n\ndet(A) * det(A⁻¹) = 1\n\nLo que implica automáticamente que:\n\ndet(A) != 0 ^ det(A⁻¹) != 0",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jr44NFtdjhJlrbC_dAl_8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9232.442343864164,
