    {
      "id": "rKLd5Zni9NOJjW2eG9sVs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9205.572685017934,
      "y": 15586.239160688529,
      "width": 1366.63330078125,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "QAvbdlvkwvtBD9SQQAf7f",
      "index": "bNFGV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 663456089,
      "version": 262,
      "versionNonce": 138562903,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781747794138,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Asumimos que tenemos el conjunto ortogonal {w1, ... , wk-1} cuyos vectores wj\nson ortogonales entre sí, es decir, <wi, wj> = 0 con i != j y tal que:\ngen{v1, ... , vk-1} = gen{w1, ... , wk-1}",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Asumimos que tenemos el conjunto ortogonal {w1, ... , wk-1} cuyos vectores wj\nson ortogonales entre sí, es decir, <wi, wj> = 0 con i != j y tal que:\ngen{v1, ... , vk-1} = gen{w1, ... , wk-1}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
